row 3 : |ISO/IEC 12207.   | 2009-10-12t00:00:00z   | 7
*/
Target column: Publish Date
Explanation: The Publish Date column contains lowercase make date formats invalid. Applying upper ensures uniform ISO format.
Selected Operation: ```upper```
Output: 2005-10-04T00:02:00Z | 2008-09-14T00:12:00Z | 2009-10-12T00:00:00Z

2. ```trim```: Removes leading and trailing whitespaces in string data.

